SUMMARY:Hunter Gatherer: The Agricultural Revolution and How It Ruined My L
 ife
LOCATION:Just the Tonic at The Caves\, 253 Cowgate\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A comedy show against every society of the past 12\,000 years a
 nd their dire consequences. Not just against the industrial revolution and 
 feudalism\, but against written language\, sedentary lifestyle\, hierarchie
 s\, racism\, spam mail\, gender roles and alcohol. In support of nomadism\,
  free camping and psychedelics. Let's take the Unabomber a step forward by 
 taking his logic a step back. Let's explore the primitive anarchists that h
 umans used to be by juxtaposing their lifestyle with ours\, through observa
 tional comedy and political commentary.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app
 /comedy-atlas/event/hunter-gatherer-the-agricultural-revolution-and-how-it-
 ruined-my-life/
